        "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Do you enjoy creating your character as much as playing them in games and RPGs?<br><br><strong>Just A Pixel Character Creator</strong> was created by fans of character creators, for everyone who loves bringing characters to life.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Pick from a variety of hairstyles, clothes, eyes, and accessories, adjust their colors, and build characters for your stories, tabletop campaigns, or profile pictures.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You can save as many characters as you like, and export them as small pixel sprites or scaled-up images — with or without backgrounds.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >-Features-</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > 8 different skins </p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > 14 different eyes </p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >50+ different hairstyles </p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >50+ different clothing pieces</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >50+ different accessories</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >10 different backgrounds</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Multiple easy-to-use color palettes</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Color-picker &amp; custom color selection</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Save, load, duplicate, rename, and delete characters from a gallery</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Export images, pixel-art-size or upscaled, with or without background</p></li></ul>",
        "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Do you enjoy creating your character as much as playing them in games and RPGs?<br><br><strong>Just A Pixel Character Creator</strong> was created by fans of character creators, for everyone who loves bringing characters to life.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Pick from a variety of hairstyles, clothes, eyes, and accessories, adjust their colors, and build characters for your stories, tabletop campaigns, or profile pictures.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You can save as many characters as you like, and export them as small pixel sprites or scaled-up images — with or without backgrounds.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >-Features-</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > 8 different skins </p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > 14 different eyes </p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >50+ different hairstyles </p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >50+ different clothing pieces</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >50+ different accessories</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >10 different backgrounds</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Multiple easy-to-use color palettes</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Color-picker &amp; custom color selection</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Save, load, duplicate, rename, and delete characters from a gallery</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Export images, pixel-art-size or upscaled, with or without background</p></li></ul>",
